# Infosys Financial Statement Analysis

## Objective
Analyze Infosys' financial performance using its annual reports for FY2023–FY2025.

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Excel
- Financial Statement Analysis
- Ratio Analysis
- KPI Cards
- Pivot Charts

## Dashboard Features
- Revenue Trend
- Net Profit Trend
- Assets vs Liabilities
- Cash Flow Analysis
- Financial Ratio Comparison

